WEBVTT

00:01:49.704 --> 00:01:52.737
You boys really screwed up this time.

00:01:56.438 --> 00:01:57.770
Where is he?

00:01:59.637 --> 00:02:01.770
You're never gonna
see your father again.

00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:07.371
They've got dad.

00:02:07.404 --> 00:02:08.737
Meg?

00:02:09.971 --> 00:02:11.137
What did she say?

00:02:11.171 --> 00:02:12.870
I just told you, sammy.

00:02:14.237 --> 00:02:18.670
Okay.

00:02:23.637 --> 00:02:25.770
What are you doing, dean?

00:02:25.804 --> 00:02:27.971
We got to go.

00:02:28.004 --> 00:02:29.971
Why?

00:02:30.004 --> 00:02:32.137
Because the demon knows
we're in salvation.

00:02:32.171 --> 00:02:33.770
It knows we've got the colt.

00:02:33.804 --> 00:02:35.438
It's probably coming for us next.

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:37.603
We've still got three bullets left.

00:02:37.637 --> 00:02:39.404
Listen, tough guy, we're not ready.

00:02:39.438 --> 00:02:41.603
We don't know how many
of them are out there.

00:02:41.637 --> 00:02:43.770
We're no good to anybody dead.

00:02:43.804 --> 00:02:46.371
We're leaving...now.

00:02:53.603 --> 00:02:57.503
I'm telling you, dean,
we could've taken him.

00:02:57.537 --> 00:02:58.971
What we need is a plan.

00:02:59.004 --> 00:03:01.503
They're keeping dad alive.
We've got to figure out where.

00:03:01.537 --> 00:03:04.171
They're gonna want to
trade him for the gun.

00:03:04.204 --> 00:03:06.470
What?

00:03:06.503 --> 00:03:09.271
If that were true, why
didn't meg mention a trade?

00:03:11.338 --> 00:03:14.371
Dad, he might be -

00:03:14.404 --> 00:03:16.537
I don't want to believe
it any more than you,

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:20.338
But if he is, all the more
reason to kill this damn thing.

00:03:20.371 --> 00:03:22.804
We still have the colt. We
can still finish the job.

00:03:22.837 --> 00:03:24.004
Screw the job, sam!

00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:26.171
Dean, i'm just trying
to do what he would want.

00:03:26.204 --> 00:03:30.004
Would you quit talking about
him like he's dead already?

00:03:30.037 --> 00:03:31.171
Listen to me.

00:03:31.204 --> 00:03:33.670
Everything stops until we get him back.

00:03:33.704 --> 00:03:35.004
Everything.

00:03:38.904 --> 00:03:40.204
So, how do we find him?

00:03:40.237 --> 00:03:41.537
Maybe we go to lincoln.

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:43.804
Start at the warehouse
where he was taken.

00:03:43.837 --> 00:03:46.237
You really think these demons
are gonna leave a trail?

00:03:46.271 --> 00:03:48.438
You're right.

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:51.971
We need help.

00:04:17.737 --> 00:04:19.737
Here you go.

00:04:21.804 --> 00:04:23.438
What is this
- Holy water?

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:25.804
That one is. This is whiskey.

00:04:31.804 --> 00:04:35.071
Bobby, thanks. Thanks for everything.

00:04:35.104 --> 00:04:37.570
To tell you the truth, i
wasn't sure if we should come.

00:04:37.603 --> 00:04:39.404
Nonsense. Your daddy needs help.

00:04:39.438 --> 00:04:40.603
The last time we saw you,

00:04:40.637 --> 00:04:42.804
You did threaten to blast
him full of buckshot.

00:04:42.837 --> 00:04:44.637
You cocked the shotgun and everything.

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:47.470
Yeah, well, what can i say?

00:04:47.503 --> 00:04:49.537
John just has that effect on people.

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:52.104
Yeah, i guess he does.

00:04:52.137 --> 00:04:53.438
None of that matters now.

00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:56.104
All that matters is
that you get him back.

00:04:56.137 --> 00:04:58.271
Bobby, this book.

00:04:58.304 --> 00:05:00.603
I've never seen anything like it.

00:05:00.637 --> 00:05:05.271
Key of solomon? It's
the real deal, all right.

00:05:05.304 --> 00:05:08.470
And these protective circles
- They really work?

00:05:08.503 --> 00:05:09.537
Hell yeah.

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:13.104
You get a demon in one, they're trapped.

00:05:13.137 --> 00:05:17.071
They're powerless. It's
like a satanic roach motel.

00:05:17.104 --> 00:05:18.570
Dean: the man knows his stuff.

00:05:18.603 --> 00:05:22.570
I'll tell you something else, too.

00:05:22.603 --> 00:05:26.071
This is some serious
crap you boys stepped in.

00:05:26.104 --> 00:05:29.570
Oh, yeah? How's that?

00:05:29.603 --> 00:05:33.770
Normal year, i hear, say,
three demonic possessions,

00:05:33.804 --> 00:05:35.804
Maybe four, tops.

00:05:35.837 --> 00:05:39.237
This year, i heard of 27 so far.

00:05:39.271 --> 00:05:40.804
You get what i'm saying?

00:05:40.837 --> 00:05:45.637
More and more demons are walking among us
- A lot more.

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:48.537
Do you know why?

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:50.870
No, but i know it's something big.

00:05:50.904 --> 00:05:56.037
The storm's coming, and
you boys, your daddy -

00:05:56.071 --> 00:05:58.470
You are smack in the middle of it.

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:05.304
Rumsfeld.

00:06:05.338 --> 00:06:06.670
What is it?

00:06:11.404 --> 00:06:13.404
Something's wrong.

00:06:18.470 --> 00:06:21.004
No more crap, okay?

00:06:29.837 --> 00:06:34.804
I want the colt,
sam - The real colt -

00:06:34.837 --> 00:06:38.304
Right now.

00:06:38.338 --> 00:06:40.704
We don't have it on us. We buried it.

00:06:40.737 --> 00:06:42.237
Didn't i say "no more crap"?

00:06:42.271 --> 00:06:45.371
I swear
- After everything i heard about you winchesters,

00:06:45.404 --> 00:06:48.804
I've got to tell you,
i'm a little underwhelmed.

00:06:48.837 --> 00:06:52.004
First johnny tries to
pawn off a fake gun,

00:06:52.037 --> 00:06:55.870
And then he leaves the real
gun with you two chuckleheads.

00:06:55.904 --> 00:06:57.404
Lackluster, men.

00:06:57.438 --> 00:07:03.603
I mean, did you really
think i wouldn't find you?

00:07:07.104 --> 00:07:10.937
Actually, we were counting on it.

00:07:24.404 --> 00:07:26.503
Gotcha.

00:07:40.438 --> 00:07:45.237
You know, if you wanted to tie me up,

00:07:45.271 --> 00:07:47.438
All you had to do was ask.

00:07:50.603 --> 00:07:52.737
I salted the doors and windows.

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:55.770
If there are any demons out
there, they ain't getting in.

00:08:03.371 --> 00:08:05.171
Where's our father, meg?

00:08:05.204 --> 00:08:07.937
You didn't ask very nice.

00:08:07.971 --> 00:08:09.503
Where's our father, bitch?

00:08:09.537 --> 00:08:13.670
Jeez. You kiss your
mother with that mouth?

00:08:13.704 --> 00:08:16.438
Oh, i forgot. You don't.

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:18.737
You think this is a freaking game?!

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:20.637
Where is he?! What did you do to him?!

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:25.137
He died screaming. I killed him myself.

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:39.670
That's kind of a turn-On
- You hitting a girl.

00:08:39.704 --> 00:08:41.304
You're no girl.

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:44.904
Dean.

00:08:46.503 --> 00:08:48.470
You okay?

00:08:48.503 --> 00:08:49.870
She's lying. He's not dead.

00:08:49.904 --> 00:08:52.438
Dean, you've got to be careful
with her. Don't hurt her.

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:54.171
Why?

00:08:54.204 --> 00:08:56.037
Because she really
is a girl. That's why.

00:08:56.071 --> 00:08:57.438
What are you talking about?

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.603
She's possessed.

00:08:58.637 --> 00:09:00.603
That's a human possessed by a demon.

00:09:00.637 --> 00:09:02.603
Can't you tell?

00:09:02.637 --> 00:09:05.438
Are you trying to tell me
there's an innocent girl

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:08.171
Trapped somewhere in there?

00:09:14.704 --> 00:09:17.037
That's actually good news.

00:09:29.171 --> 00:09:31.304
Are you gonna read me a story?

00:09:31.338 --> 00:09:35.037
Something like that. Hit it, sam.

00:09:35.071 --> 00:09:41.237
<i>"Regna terrae, cantTe
deo, psLlite dMino..."</i>

00:09:41.271 --> 00:09:45.404
An exorcism? Are you serious?

00:09:45.438 --> 00:09:47.271
We're going for it, baby
- Head spinning,

00:09:47.304 --> 00:09:49.904
Projectile vomiting,
the whole nine yards.

00:09:49.937 --> 00:09:52.470
<i>"Tribuite virtutem deo."</i>

00:09:59.104 --> 00:10:02.737
I'm gonna kill you.

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:06.071
I'm gonna rip the bones from your body.

00:10:06.104 --> 00:10:08.237
No, you're gonna burn in hell

00:10:08.271 --> 00:10:10.237
Unless you tell us where our dad is.

00:10:12.537 --> 00:10:16.271
Well, at least you'll get a nice tan.

00:10:18.770 --> 00:10:22.937
<i>"Exorcizamus te, omnis
immundus spiritus,</i>

00:10:22.971 --> 00:10:26.204
<i>"Omnis satanica potestas,</i>

00:10:26.237 --> 00:10:29.071
<i>"Omnis incursio infernalis
adversarii, omnis legio,</i>

00:10:29.104 --> 00:10:32.071
<i>"Omnis congregatio et secta diabolica."</i>

00:10:32.104 --> 00:10:33.404
Aah!

00:10:34.404 --> 00:10:39.537
He begged for his life
with tears in his eyes.

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:43.404
He begged to see his sons one last time.

00:10:43.438 --> 00:10:45.204
That's when i slit his throat.

00:10:50.937 --> 00:10:51.904
<i>"Ergo..."</i>

00:10:51.937 --> 00:10:56.071
For your sake, i hope you're lying.

00:10:56.104 --> 00:10:58.304
'Cause if it's true, i swear to god,

00:10:58.338 --> 00:11:00.271
I will march into hell myself,

00:11:00.304 --> 00:11:02.704
And i will slaughter each and every one

00:11:02.737 --> 00:11:05.404
Of you evil sons of
bitches, so help me god.

00:11:05.438 --> 00:11:08.104
<i>"Perditionis venenum propinare.</i>

00:11:08.137 --> 00:11:14.937
<i>"Vade, satana, inventor et
magister omnis fallaciae,</i>

00:11:14.971 --> 00:11:17.770
<i>"Hostis humanae salutis.</i>

00:11:17.804 --> 00:11:21.271
<i>"Humiliare sub potenti manu
dei, contremisce et effuge,</i>

00:11:21.304 --> 00:11:25.004
<i>"Invocato a nobis sancto
et terribili nomine,</i>

00:11:25.037 --> 00:11:27.104
<i>Quem inferi tremunt."</i>

00:11:27.137 --> 00:11:28.603
Aah!

00:11:28.637 --> 00:11:29.971
Where is he?

00:11:31.837 --> 00:11:34.137
You just won't take "dead"
for an answer, will you?

00:11:34.171 --> 00:11:35.971
Where is he?!

00:11:36.004 --> 00:11:37.637
Dead! No, he's not!

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:39.570
He's not dead! He can't be!

00:11:43.037 --> 00:11:45.004
What are you looking at? Keep reading.

00:11:45.037 --> 00:11:48.171
<i>"Ab insidiis diaboli,
libera nos, domine.</i>

00:11:48.204 --> 00:11:53.704
<i>"Ut ecclesiam tuam secura
tibi facias libertate servire,</i>

00:11:53.737 --> 00:11:56.338
<i>Te rogamus, audi nos."</i>

00:11:56.371 --> 00:11:59.171
Aaaah!

00:11:59.204 --> 00:12:03.503
<i>"Ut inimicos sanctae
ecclesiae humiliare digneris,</i>

00:12:03.537 --> 00:12:05.304
<i>Te rogamus audi
-"</i>

00:12:05.338 --> 00:12:06.470
He will be!

00:12:06.503 --> 00:12:07.470
Wait! What?!

00:12:07.503 --> 00:12:09.037
He's not dead,

00:12:09.071 --> 00:12:12.304
But he will be after what we do to him.

00:12:13.904 --> 00:12:16.470
How do we know you're telling the truth?

00:12:16.503 --> 00:12:17.704
You don't.

00:12:17.737 --> 00:12:19.204
Sam! A building!

00:12:19.237 --> 00:12:21.971
Okay? A building in jefferson city.

00:12:22.004 --> 00:12:24.737
Missouri? Where, where? An address.

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:25.870
I don't know.

00:12:25.904 --> 00:12:27.503
And the demon
- Where is it?

00:12:27.537 --> 00:12:29.204
I don't know. I swear.

00:12:30.904 --> 00:12:33.904
That's everything. That's all i know.

00:12:38.304 --> 00:12:39.570
Finish it.

00:12:39.603 --> 00:12:41.404
What? I told you the truth.

00:12:41.438 --> 00:12:42.904
I don't care.

00:12:42.937 --> 00:12:44.404
You son of a bitch. You promised.

00:12:44.438 --> 00:12:46.737
I lied!

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:48.603
Sam?

00:12:50.737 --> 00:12:52.570
Sam!

00:12:54.371 --> 00:12:56.171
Read.

00:12:56.204 --> 00:12:59.004
We can still use her, find
out where the demon is.

00:12:59.037 --> 00:13:00.338
She doesn't know.

00:13:00.371 --> 00:13:03.037
There's an innocent girl
trapped somewhere in there.

00:13:03.071 --> 00:13:04.637
We've got to help her.

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:06.271
You're gonna kill her.

00:13:06.304 --> 00:13:07.438
What?

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:11.037
You said she fell from a building.

00:13:12.737 --> 00:13:15.237
That girl's body is broken.

00:13:15.271 --> 00:13:18.870
The only thing keeping her
alive is that demon inside.

00:13:18.904 --> 00:13:22.071
You exorcise it, the girl is gonna die.

00:13:22.104 --> 00:13:24.137
We are not gonna leave her like that.

00:13:24.171 --> 00:13:25.304
She is a human being.

00:13:25.338 --> 00:13:28.204
And we're gonna put
her out of her misery.

00:13:28.237 --> 00:13:30.704
Sam, finish it.

00:13:39.470 --> 00:13:42.304
Finish it.

00:13:49.271 --> 00:13:53.904
<i>"Dominicos sanctae ecclesiae.</i>

00:13:53.937 --> 00:13:55.570
<i>"Terogamus audi nos.</i>

00:13:55.603 --> 00:13:59.404
<i>"Terribilis deus de
sanctuario suo deus israhel</i>

00:13:59.438 --> 00:14:03.570
<i>"Ipse tribuite virtutem
et fortitudinem plebi suae.</i>

00:14:03.603 --> 00:14:06.271
<i>Benedictus deus. Gloria patri."</i>

00:14:42.004 --> 00:14:43.470
Dean: she's still alive.

00:14:43.503 --> 00:14:46.603
Call 911. Get some water and blankets.

00:14:49.704 --> 00:14:52.503
Thank you.

00:14:52.537 --> 00:14:55.171
Shh, shh, just take it easy, all right?

00:14:55.204 --> 00:14:56.371
Thank you.

00:14:56.404 --> 00:14:57.470
Shh.

00:14:57.503 --> 00:14:59.204
Come on. Let's get her down.

00:15:01.404 --> 00:15:04.870
Sorry, sorry.

00:15:04.904 --> 00:15:07.570
I've got you. I've got you.

00:15:07.603 --> 00:15:09.503
It's okay. It's okay.

00:15:09.537 --> 00:15:13.338
A year.

00:15:13.371 --> 00:15:14.870
What?

00:15:14.904 --> 00:15:16.870
It's been a year.

00:15:16.904 --> 00:15:19.171
Just take it easy.

00:15:19.204 --> 00:15:23.004
I've been awake for some of it.

00:15:26.637 --> 00:15:29.304
I couldn't move my own body.

00:15:30.904 --> 00:15:36.037
The things i did
- It's a nightmare.

00:15:36.071 --> 00:15:38.704
Was it telling us the
truth about our dad?

00:15:38.737 --> 00:15:40.537
Dean.

00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:41.770
We need to know.

00:15:41.804 --> 00:15:43.371
Yes.

00:15:45.104 --> 00:15:51.271
But it wants... you to know

00:15:51.304 --> 00:15:55.204
That...they want you to come for him.

00:15:55.237 --> 00:15:58.171
If dad's still alive,
none of that matters.

00:16:09.637 --> 00:16:11.637
Where is the demon we're looking for?

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:13.470
Not there.

00:16:13.503 --> 00:16:17.637
Other ones.

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:19.204
Awful ones.

00:16:20.338 --> 00:16:22.304
Where are they keeping our dad?

00:16:22.338 --> 00:16:26.904
By the r-River.

00:16:30.603 --> 00:16:32.937
Sunrise.

00:16:32.971 --> 00:16:35.271
"Sunrise"? What does that mean?

00:16:37.371 --> 00:16:39.704
What does that mean?

00:17:13.757 --> 00:17:14.357
You better hurry up and beat it

00:17:15.124 --> 00:17:16.791
Before the paramedics get here.

00:17:16.824 --> 00:17:18.323
What are you gonna tell them?

00:17:18.357 --> 00:17:21.323
You think you guys
invented lying to the cops?

00:17:21.357 --> 00:17:23.957
I'll figure something out.

00:17:23.991 --> 00:17:27.290
Here. Take this. You might need it.

00:17:27.323 --> 00:17:29.091
Thanks.

00:17:30.323 --> 00:17:33.557
Thanks...for everything.

00:17:33.590 --> 00:17:35.024
Be careful, all right?

00:17:35.058 --> 00:17:36.490
Just go find your dad.

00:17:36.524 --> 00:17:39.757
And when you do, you bring
him around, would you?

00:17:39.791 --> 00:17:42.091
I won't even try to shoot him this time.

00:18:14.957 --> 00:18:16.957
You've been quiet.

00:18:18.891 --> 00:18:21.058
Just getting ready.

00:18:24.424 --> 00:18:27.424
He's gonna be fine, dean.

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:48.857
Dude, what are you drawing on my car?

00:18:48.891 --> 00:18:51.857
It's called a devil's trap.

00:18:51.891 --> 00:18:54.190
Demons can't get
through it or inside it.

00:18:54.223 --> 00:18:55.557
So?

00:18:55.590 --> 00:18:58.924
It basically turns the
trunk into a lockbox.

00:19:00.924 --> 00:19:02.724
So?

00:19:02.757 --> 00:19:05.724
So we have a place to hide
the colt while we go get dad.

00:19:05.757 --> 00:19:08.557
What are you talking about?
We're bringing the colt with us.

00:19:08.590 --> 00:19:09.891
We can't, dean.

00:19:09.924 --> 00:19:11.657
We've only got three bullets left.

00:19:11.691 --> 00:19:13.524
We can't just use them on any demon.

00:19:13.557 --> 00:19:15.190
<i>We've got to use them on the demon.</i>

00:19:15.223 --> 00:19:17.323
No, we have to save dad, sam, okay?

00:19:17.357 --> 00:19:19.757
We're gonna need all
the help we can get.

00:19:19.791 --> 00:19:22.357
You know how pissed dad would
be if we used all the bullets?

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:24.524
Dean, he wouldn't want
us to bring the gun.

00:19:24.557 --> 00:19:25.924
I don't care, sam!

00:19:25.957 --> 00:19:27.524
I don't care what dad wants, okay?

00:19:27.557 --> 00:19:29.357
Since when do you care what dad wants?

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:32.058
We want to kill this demon.
You used to want that, too.

00:19:32.091 --> 00:19:34.557
Hell, you're the one who
came and got me at school!

00:19:34.590 --> 00:19:36.390
You're the one who dragged me into this.

00:19:36.424 --> 00:19:38.158
I'm just trying to finish it.

00:19:43.424 --> 00:19:46.091
Well, you and dad are a lot
more alike than i thought.

00:19:46.124 --> 00:19:48.757
You both can't wait to sacrifice
yourself for this thing.

00:19:48.791 --> 00:19:51.691
But you know what? I'm
gonna be the one to bury you.

00:19:56.058 --> 00:19:57.524
You're selfish, you know that?

00:19:57.557 --> 00:19:59.857
You don't care about
anything but revenge.

00:19:59.891 --> 00:20:01.857
That's not true, dean.

00:20:01.891 --> 00:20:03.824
I want dad back,

00:20:03.857 --> 00:20:05.991
But they are expecting
us to bring this gun.

00:20:06.024 --> 00:20:08.323
They get the gun, they will kill us all.

00:20:08.357 --> 00:20:11.158
That colt is our only
leverage, and you know it, dean.

00:20:11.190 --> 00:20:14.757
We cannot bring that gun. We can't.

00:20:14.791 --> 00:20:16.624
Fine.

00:20:16.657 --> 00:20:19.223
I'm serious, dean. I said "fine," sam.

00:20:49.323 --> 00:20:51.624
Hey, hey.

00:20:51.657 --> 00:20:56.490
I think i know what
meg meant by "sunrise."

00:21:06.024 --> 00:21:09.457
Son of a bitch. That's pretty smart.

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:11.290
If these demons can possess people,

00:21:11.323 --> 00:21:13.457
They can possess almost anybody inside.

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:15.957
And make anybody attack us.

00:21:15.991 --> 00:21:17.290
And so we can't kill 'em -

00:21:17.323 --> 00:21:19.691
A building full of human shields.

00:21:19.724 --> 00:21:22.490
They probably know exactly
what we look like, too,

00:21:22.524 --> 00:21:24.457
And they could look like anybody.

00:21:24.490 --> 00:21:26.158
This sucks out loud.

00:21:26.190 --> 00:21:31.257
All right, so, how the
hell are we gonna get in?

00:21:32.590 --> 00:21:37.024
Pull the fire alarm, get
out all the civilians.

00:21:37.058 --> 00:21:39.024
But then the city
responds in seven minutes.

00:21:39.058 --> 00:21:41.124
Seven minutes, exactly.

00:22:42.991 --> 00:22:44.457
You okay?

00:22:49.691 --> 00:22:51.323
Hey, what's happening? Is it a fire?

00:22:51.357 --> 00:22:53.158
We're figuring that out right now, sir.

00:22:53.190 --> 00:22:54.657
Just stay back.

00:22:54.691 --> 00:22:57.158
I got a yorkie upstairs, and
he pees when he's nervous.

00:22:57.190 --> 00:23:00.924
Sir, you have to stay back.

00:23:20.490 --> 00:23:23.158
I always wanted to be a
fireman when i grew up.

00:23:23.190 --> 00:23:25.323
You never told me that.

00:23:49.257 --> 00:23:52.757
This is the fire department.
We need you to evacuate.

00:24:22.190 --> 00:24:23.590
Hurry up!

00:24:58.757 --> 00:25:00.158
Dad.

00:25:07.158 --> 00:25:09.390
He's still breathing.

00:25:09.424 --> 00:25:11.590
Dad, wake up.

00:25:11.624 --> 00:25:12.891
Dad!

00:25:16.158 --> 00:25:17.457
Wait. Wait.

00:25:17.490 --> 00:25:18.624
What?

00:25:18.657 --> 00:25:20.691
He could be possessed, for all we know.

00:25:20.724 --> 00:25:23.457
What, are you nuts?

00:25:23.490 --> 00:25:25.257
Dean, we got to be sure.

00:25:46.957 --> 00:25:49.624
Sam?

00:25:52.290 --> 00:25:55.124
Why are you splashing water on me?

00:25:56.857 --> 00:25:59.557
Dad, are you okay?

00:25:59.590 --> 00:26:03.091
They've been drugging me.

00:26:03.124 --> 00:26:04.757
Where's the colt?

00:26:04.791 --> 00:26:07.624
Don't worry, dad, it's safe.

00:26:09.223 --> 00:26:12.824
Good, boys. Good, boys.

00:26:32.323 --> 00:26:33.791
Hey, buddy, you can't go in.

00:26:47.557 --> 00:26:48.524
Go!

00:26:48.557 --> 00:26:49.524
Back, back!

00:26:49.557 --> 00:26:51.557
Go!

00:26:58.204 --> 00:27:00.737
Sam, let's go!

00:27:18.838 --> 00:27:20.671
Sam!

00:27:54.537 --> 00:27:56.170
Sam!

00:27:56.204 --> 00:27:59.437
Sam, come on. Come on.

00:28:08.370 --> 00:28:10.003
Come on.

00:28:10.037 --> 00:28:12.237
Come on, we've got to get out of here.

00:28:51.970 --> 00:28:53.437
How is he?

00:28:53.471 --> 00:28:56.103
He just needed a
little rest, that's all.

00:28:56.137 --> 00:28:59.103
How are you?

00:28:59.137 --> 00:29:03.970
[ Inhales deeply ] i'll survive.

00:29:06.103 --> 00:29:09.070
Hey, you don't think we
were followed here, do you?

00:29:09.103 --> 00:29:10.737
I don't know. I don't think so.

00:29:10.771 --> 00:29:11.804
We couldn't have found

00:29:11.838 --> 00:29:13.704
A more out-Of-The-Way
place to hole up.

00:29:13.737 --> 00:29:16.270
Yeah.

00:29:20.270 --> 00:29:21.938
Hey, uh...

00:29:24.571 --> 00:29:26.537
Dean, you, um...

00:29:29.437 --> 00:29:32.404
You saved my life back there.

00:29:32.437 --> 00:29:36.037
So i guess you're glad
i brought the gun, huh?

00:29:36.070 --> 00:29:40.204
Man, i'm trying to thank you here.

00:29:42.437 --> 00:29:44.604
You're welcome.

00:29:55.571 --> 00:29:57.037
Hey, sam?

00:29:57.070 --> 00:29:59.037
Yeah?

00:29:59.070 --> 00:30:02.204
You know that guy i shot?

00:30:02.237 --> 00:30:04.571
There was a person in there.

00:30:09.471 --> 00:30:11.938
You didn't have a choice, dean.

00:30:11.970 --> 00:30:15.270
I know. That's not what bothers me.

00:30:15.304 --> 00:30:18.804
Then what does?

00:30:22.904 --> 00:30:25.571
Killing that guy, killing meg.

00:30:27.571 --> 00:30:30.904
I didn't hesitate. I didn't even flinch.

00:30:33.504 --> 00:30:36.471
For you or dad, the things
i'm willing to do or kill,

00:30:36.504 --> 00:30:38.504
It's just...

00:30:40.838 --> 00:30:43.671
It scares me sometimes.

00:30:50.170 --> 00:30:53.804
It shouldn't.

00:30:53.838 --> 00:30:55.504
You did good.

00:30:55.537 --> 00:30:57.871
You're not mad?

00:30:57.904 --> 00:31:00.471
For what?

00:31:00.504 --> 00:31:02.804
Using a bullet.

00:31:04.604 --> 00:31:08.037
Mad? I'm proud of you.

00:31:09.671 --> 00:31:14.237
You know, sam and i, we
can get pretty obsessed.

00:31:14.270 --> 00:31:19.370
But you
- You watch out for this family.

00:31:19.404 --> 00:31:21.537
You always have.

00:31:27.970 --> 00:31:29.270
Thanks.

00:31:41.237 --> 00:31:44.170
It found us. It's here. The demon?

00:31:44.204 --> 00:31:46.637
Sam, lines of salt in front
of every window, ever door.

00:31:46.671 --> 00:31:47.970
Already did it.

00:31:48.003 --> 00:31:50.437
Check it, okay?

00:31:50.471 --> 00:31:52.771
Dean, you got the gun? Yeah.

00:31:52.804 --> 00:31:54.771
Give it to me. Sam
tried to shoot the demon.

00:31:54.804 --> 00:31:56.604
It vanished.

00:31:56.637 --> 00:32:00.904
I won't miss. Now, the gun. Hurry.

00:32:04.537 --> 00:32:07.070
Son, please.

00:32:13.970 --> 00:32:16.604
Give me the gun. What
are you doing, dean?

00:32:16.637 --> 00:32:18.170
You'd be furious.

00:32:18.204 --> 00:32:19.170
What?

00:32:19.204 --> 00:32:20.571
That i wasted a bullet.

00:32:20.604 --> 00:32:23.571
He wouldn't be proud of
me. He'd tear me a new one.

00:32:30.537 --> 00:32:33.304
You're not my dad.

00:32:36.604 --> 00:32:38.904
I know my dad better than anyone,

00:32:38.937 --> 00:32:40.737
And you ain't him.

00:32:40.770 --> 00:32:42.338
What the hell has gotten into you?

00:32:42.370 --> 00:32:44.503
I could ask you the same thing.

00:32:44.537 --> 00:32:47.670
Dean? What the hell is going on?

00:32:47.704 --> 00:32:49.670
Your brother's lost his mind.

00:32:49.704 --> 00:32:50.837
He's not dad.

00:32:50.871 --> 00:32:52.004
What?

00:32:52.037 --> 00:32:53.238
I think he's possessed.

00:32:53.271 --> 00:32:55.503
I think he's been possessed
since we rescued him.

00:32:55.537 --> 00:32:57.537
Don't listen to him.
Dean, how do you know?

00:32:57.570 --> 00:32:59.037
He's different.

00:32:59.071 --> 00:33:00.271
We don't have time for this.

00:33:00.304 --> 00:33:02.570
Sam, if you want to kill this demon,

00:33:02.604 --> 00:33:04.403
You've got to trust me.

00:33:09.271 --> 00:33:11.370
Sam?

00:33:18.470 --> 00:33:20.137
No.

00:33:22.071 --> 00:33:23.238
No.

00:33:32.904 --> 00:33:34.238
Fine.

00:33:35.971 --> 00:33:41.004
You're both so sure. Go ahead.

00:33:42.470 --> 00:33:45.370
Kill me.

00:33:58.004 --> 00:34:00.670
I thought so.

00:34:13.937 --> 00:34:19.737
What a pain in the
ass this thing's been.

00:34:19.770 --> 00:34:23.403
It's you, isn't it?

00:34:23.437 --> 00:34:26.804
We've been looking for
you for a long time.

00:34:26.837 --> 00:34:28.570
Well, you found me.

00:34:28.604 --> 00:34:30.004
But the holy water?

00:34:30.037 --> 00:34:33.470
You think something like that
works on something like me?

00:34:38.570 --> 00:34:40.204
I'm gonna kill you!

00:34:40.238 --> 00:34:44.204
Oh, that would be a neat trick.

00:34:44.238 --> 00:34:47.370
In fact, here.

00:34:47.403 --> 00:34:51.804
Make the gun float to
you there, psychic boy.

00:35:00.704 --> 00:35:02.370
Well, this is fun.

00:35:02.403 --> 00:35:06.537
I could've killed you a
hundred times today, but this...

00:35:08.804 --> 00:35:10.670
This is worth the wait.

00:35:13.871 --> 00:35:19.737
Your dad
- He's in here with me,

00:35:19.770 --> 00:35:22.071
Trapped inside his own meat suit.

00:35:22.104 --> 00:35:24.470
He says "hi," by the way.

00:35:24.503 --> 00:35:26.604
He's gonna tear you apart.

00:35:29.604 --> 00:35:31.338
He's gonna taste the iron in your blood.

00:35:31.370 --> 00:35:33.503
Let him go, or i swear to god -

00:35:33.537 --> 00:35:38.338
What? What are you and god gonna do?

00:35:38.370 --> 00:35:43.104
You see, as far as i'm
concerned, this is justice.

00:35:47.403 --> 00:35:52.037
You know that little exorcism of yours?

00:35:52.071 --> 00:35:54.937
That was my daughter.

00:35:54.971 --> 00:35:56.271
Who, meg?

00:35:56.304 --> 00:35:57.971
The one in the alley?

00:36:00.071 --> 00:36:02.704
That was my boy.

00:36:02.737 --> 00:36:04.204
You understand?

00:36:04.238 --> 00:36:06.171
You've got to be kidding me.

00:36:06.204 --> 00:36:09.004
What? You're the only one
that can have a family?

00:36:09.037 --> 00:36:12.537
You destroyed my children.

00:36:12.570 --> 00:36:15.304
How would you feel if
i killed your family?

00:36:20.770 --> 00:36:24.238
Oh, that's right.

00:36:24.271 --> 00:36:26.271
I forgot. I did.

00:36:28.570 --> 00:36:33.570
Still, two wrongs don't make a right.

00:36:33.604 --> 00:36:36.071
You son of a bitch.

00:36:36.104 --> 00:36:39.637
I want to know why. Why did you do it?

00:36:39.670 --> 00:36:43.238
You mean why did i kill
mommy and pretty, little jess?

00:36:43.271 --> 00:36:44.437
Yeah.

00:36:44.470 --> 00:36:47.604
You know, i never told you this,

00:36:47.637 --> 00:36:50.971
But sam was gonna ask her to marry him.

00:36:51.004 --> 00:36:54.804
Been shopping for rings and everything.

00:36:54.837 --> 00:36:58.004
You want to know why?

00:36:58.037 --> 00:37:00.171
Because they got in the way.

00:37:00.204 --> 00:37:01.737
In the way of what?

00:37:01.770 --> 00:37:03.238
My plans for you, sammy -

00:37:03.271 --> 00:37:07.670
You...and all the children like you.

00:37:07.704 --> 00:37:11.338
Listen, you mind just
getting this over with, huh?

00:37:11.370 --> 00:37:14.004
'Cause i really can't
stand the monologuing.

00:37:14.037 --> 00:37:17.503
Funny, but that's all part
of your m.O., isn't it?

00:37:17.537 --> 00:37:21.904
Mask all that nasty
pain, mask the truth.

00:37:21.937 --> 00:37:24.104
Oh, yeah? What's that?

00:37:24.137 --> 00:37:26.437
You know, you fight, and
you fight for this family,

00:37:26.470 --> 00:37:31.670
But the truth is they don't need you.

00:37:31.704 --> 00:37:33.971
Not like you need them.

00:37:36.004 --> 00:37:40.037
Sam
- He's clearly john's favorite.

00:37:40.071 --> 00:37:42.604
Even when they fight,

00:37:42.637 --> 00:37:45.904
It's more concern than
he's ever shown you.

00:37:48.037 --> 00:37:52.004
I bet you're real proud
of your kids, too, huh?

00:37:52.037 --> 00:37:56.837
Oh, wait, i forgot. I wasted 'em.

00:38:10.537 --> 00:38:11.971
Aah!

00:38:12.004 --> 00:38:14.537
Dean!

00:38:14.570 --> 00:38:16.204
No!

00:38:23.171 --> 00:38:25.704
Dad!

00:38:25.737 --> 00:38:28.770
Dad, don't you let it kill me!

00:38:30.370 --> 00:38:32.004
Dean!

00:38:45.470 --> 00:38:47.604
Dad, please.

00:38:55.470 --> 00:38:56.904
Dean!

00:38:59.104 --> 00:39:01.837
No! Stop.

00:39:03.604 --> 00:39:05.437
Stop it.

00:39:13.238 --> 00:39:17.104
You kill me, you kill daddy.

00:39:17.137 --> 00:39:18.737
I know.

00:39:29.171 --> 00:39:32.137
Dean? Dean? Hey.

00:39:32.171 --> 00:39:33.637
Oh, god, you lost a lot of blood.

00:39:33.670 --> 00:39:35.804
Where's dad?

00:39:35.837 --> 00:39:37.937
He's right here. He's right here, dean.

00:39:37.971 --> 00:39:42.437
Go check on him.

00:39:50.637 --> 00:39:54.770
Dad?

00:39:54.804 --> 00:39:57.104
Sammy!

00:39:57.137 --> 00:40:00.837
It's still alive. It's
inside me. I can feel it.

00:40:00.871 --> 00:40:02.004
You shoot me.

00:40:02.037 --> 00:40:05.503
You shoot me! You shoot
me in the heart, son!

00:40:05.537 --> 00:40:08.071
Do it, now!

00:40:08.104 --> 00:40:09.904
Sam, don't you do it. Don't you do it.

00:40:09.937 --> 00:40:11.338
You've got to hurry.

00:40:11.370 --> 00:40:13.271
I can't hold on to it much longer.

00:40:13.304 --> 00:40:16.437
You shoot me, son! Shoot me!

00:40:16.470 --> 00:40:19.670
Son, i'm begging you! We
can end this here and now!

00:40:20.837 --> 00:40:23.470
Sammy, you kill me!

00:40:23.503 --> 00:40:24.637
Sam, no.

00:40:24.670 --> 00:40:27.370
You do this!

00:40:27.403 --> 00:40:29.937
Sammy!

00:40:29.971 --> 00:40:33.304
Sam, sam...

00:40:37.338 --> 00:40:39.271
I'm begging you, son. You've got to.

00:40:39.304 --> 00:40:42.338
I can't hold on to it much longer.

00:40:42.370 --> 00:40:44.238
Shoot me!

00:41:10.204 --> 00:41:13.671
Look, just hold on, all right?

00:41:13.704 --> 00:41:17.037
The hospital is only 10 minutes away.

00:41:17.070 --> 00:41:20.804
I'm surprised at you, sammy.
Why didn't you kill it?

00:41:20.838 --> 00:41:23.137
I thought we saw
eye-To-Eye on this.

00:41:23.170 --> 00:41:24.704
Killing this demon comes first -

00:41:24.737 --> 00:41:27.404
Before me, before everything.

00:41:29.970 --> 00:41:33.871
No, sir, not before everything.

00:41:33.904 --> 00:41:37.070
Look, we've still got the colt.

00:41:37.103 --> 00:41:38.737
We still have the one bullet left.

00:41:38.771 --> 00:41:40.571
We just have to start over, all right?

00:41:40.604 --> 00:41:41.938
We already found the demon -



00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.000
